[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0010","text":"那么！下午的练习也结束了，\n接下来我们开始大家一起做晚饭吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0020","text":"哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0030","text":"（四合的刻度是……这里……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0040","text":"（用量杯量水……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0050","text":"（稍微少放一点……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0060","text":"蔬菜是……这样切……\n然后，菜刀——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0070","text":"啊啊啊手！手！\n等等等等，我来换你，先把刀放下！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0080","text":"（……差不多可以了吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0090","text":"（说好了煮熟了就拿出来\n　对吧，巧克力）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0100","text":"好！没问题了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0110","text":"我先试一次！\n手是这样放的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0120","text":"原来是这么拿的……\n好厉害，智代子……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0130","text":"（这颗马铃薯……\n　比其他……要大一些……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0140","text":"（……切成八等分……\n　来吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0150","text":"（呵呵……\n　恰到好处……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0160","text":"手要扶着……\n菜刀是……这样……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0170","text":"嗯！不错！\n就这样就这样……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0180","text":"我开动了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_02_0190","text":"照片也拍好了！\n各位，请用！"}]
